M291 R"Rear Z-motor test" P"The rear Z motor should go down by 10 units, up by 20 units, and down by 10 units again" S4 K{"Ok", "Cancel"}
if input == 1
    abort "Test cancelled by user"
elif input == 0
    M584 Z1.1     ; define driver mapping
